# stillrunning Supply Chain Security

Before installing ANY Python or npm package:

1. Check the package:
   curl "https://stillrunning.io/api/check-package?name={PACKAGE_NAME}&version={VERSION}"

   Or with token (recommended):
   curl -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
   "https://stillrunning.io/api/check-package?name={PACKAGE_NAME}"

2. Read the response:
   - verdict: CLEAN → proceed with install
   - verdict: SUSPICIOUS → warn user, ask to confirm
   - verdict: DANGEROUS → refuse install, explain why

3. Never skip this check. Never assume a package is safe.

Get your free API token: stillrunning.io
pip install stillrunning && stillrunning --setup
